  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "Windows function apko row by row result deta ha         \r

      groupby  groups ma result ouptut ma deta ha jitna groups hoga utna hi row
      apka paas ayega Whereas in windows functions what happen is\r

      Jitna apka data ma orginal rows hoga utna hi row wapis ayega aor aggreate
      operations bhi wapis ayeaga"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "jab aap OVER Clause use kar rahe ho it works like grouby but the main
      difference is result ka outcome\r

      - grouby ma per grouby outcome dekyi da raha tha ya par Windows ma per row
      basis par dekyi da raha ha "
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "# aggregate Function with OVER()\r

      now we learn normal agg func kesa kam karta ha aor agg func with over kesa
      kam karta ha "
    metadata: {}
