    languageId: markdown
    value: "Deko agar 2 bacho ka marks same ha then unka rank bhi same
      hoga         \r

      deko yadi ek baar rank use example vinay and rohit same marks alloted then
      rank 1 aab sida third rank ayegi. because second position rank use ho
      gayi  ha "
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "## Dense rank\r

      \r

      \r

      | marks | rank | dense rank |\r

      |------ |------|-----------|\r

      |   95  |  1   |     1      |\r

      |   95  |  1   |     1      |\r

      |   98  |  3   |     2      |"
    metadata: {}
